\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVệ sinh sạch sẽ trước \u0026amp; sau khi sử dụng\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eĐể đảm bảo tính an toàn tuyệt đối nếu dùng cho trẻ nhỏ nên tráng rửa qua nước sôi 100 độ C trước khi sử dụng\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKhông sử dụng những vật dụng sắc nhọn hoặc có bề mặt thô/ nhám cao để cọ rửa vệ sinh sản phẩm, sản phẩm có thể sẽ bị xước hỏng, nứt vỡ và mất tính thẩm mỹ nếu sử dụng không đúng cách\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBảo quản nơi khô thoáng, sạch sẽ!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/60/62/69/ee50bd59ccd3c8d3d72d4ef7e7cdaea1.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/60/62/69/ee50bd59ccd3c8d3d72d4ef7e7cdaea1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/6b/4f/14/f47eb5f6950bdda3c0798d0c648e9d36.jpeg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/6b/4f/14/f47eb5f6950bdda3c0798d0c648e9d36.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/f7/f3/07/f7995c09375de9e0f9d502dabe4f1ea9.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/f7/f3/07/f7995c09375de9e0f9d502dabe4f1ea9.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"undefined\" height=\"undefined\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e3/59/9d/31676477eaea0ff89617e021837b605a.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e3/59/9d/31676477eaea0ff89617e021837b605a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/66/e9/e5/9d02ef20854be62798f2d309909bca4e.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/66/e9/e5/9d02ef20854be627